{"id":"xxgk-c12020a422609","title":"关于申请2026年春季学期公共选修课程、A系列课程及美育课程教学任务的通知","date":"2025-11-20","source":"xxgk","source_name":"信息公开","channel":"最新信息公开","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/2025/1120/c12020a422609/page.htm","summary":"各学院（单位）、各任课教师： 为做好 2026 年春季学期教学工作安排，现开展 2026 年春季学期公共选修课程、 A 系列课程及美育课程教学任务申请工作，具体有关事项通知如下： 1 、申请时间： 2025 年 11 月 20 日 12:00—11 月 25 日 17:00 。 2 、申请流程 : 开课教师登录新教务系统（正方教务系统）申请，具体操作指南见附…","content_html":"<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\"><p><span><span><span><span>各学院（单位）、各任课教师：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>    为做好</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年春季学期教学工作安排，现开展</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年春季学期公共选修课程、</span></span></span></span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span><span><span>系列课程及美育课程教学任务申请工作，具体有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、申请时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00—11</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>17:00</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、申请流程</span></span></span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span><span><span>开课教师登录新教务系统（正方教务系统）申请，具体操作指南见附件。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、申请要求：同一门课程同一教师最多可申请开设</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个教学班，且必须安排在不同校区，每个教学班设定选课人数上限为</span></span></span></span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、各任课教师可以根据实际情况选择两节连上或三节连上。两节连上可选择的上课时间</span></span></span></span><span><span>: 10-11</span></span><span><span><span><span>节（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1-16</span></span><span><span><span><span>周）、</span></span></span></span><span><span>13-14</span></span><span><span><span><span>节（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1-16</span></span><span><span><span><span>周）；三节连上可选择的上课时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span>10-12</span></span><span><span><span><span>节（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1-11</span></span><span><span><span><span>周）、</span></span></span></span><span><span>13-15</span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1-11</span></span><span><span><span><span>周）。注：第十节上课开始时间为</span></span></span></span><span><span>16:25</span></span><span><span><span><span>，第十三节上课开始时间为</span></span></span></span><span><span>19:30</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>另外，任课教师在申请任务时所选上课时间及人数只作排课时参考，本科生院有权根据学校教室资源和排课的具体情况进行调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span> 5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、学院（单位）工作安排：请各单位教务员于</span></span></span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span><span><span>日从新教务系统导出本单位公共选修课程及</span></span></span></span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span><span><span>系列课程教学任务汇总表（导出路径：通识课管理</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>通识选修课查询</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>通识选修课任务通知书下载），经任课教师检查无误并签字确认（如需修改，请在任务书上注明），加盖单位公章后于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span><span><span>日下午</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>17:00</span></span><span><span><span><span>前送本科生院教学运行科（行政楼</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>306</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>    联系人：朱老师    联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>85286194</span></span></p><p><span><span>    附件：<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/11/68/42422c9843f0b8c01e1c97ea2810/76225c38-6ffb-4a91-a98e-ed49e33a13bc.docx\">新教务系统（正方教务系统）教师申请公共选修课程、A系列课程及美育课程教学任务操作手册 .docx</a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>              本科生院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>              2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p></div>","content_text":"各学院（单位）、各任课教师：\n为做好\n2026\n年春季学期教学工作安排，现开展\n2026\n年春季学期公共选修课程、\nA\n系列课程及美育课程教学任务申请工作，具体有关事项通知如下：\n1\n、申请时间：\n2025\n年\n11\n月\n20\n日\n12:00—11\n月\n25\n日\n17:00\n。\n2\n、申请流程\n:\n开课教师登录新教务系统（正方教务系统）申请，具体操作指南见附件。\n3\n、申请要求：同一门课程同一教师最多可申请开设\n2\n个教学班，且必须安排在不同校区，每个教学班设定选课人数上限为\n150\n人。\n4\n、各任课教师可以根据实际情况选择两节连上或三节连上。两节连上可选择的上课时间\n: 10-11\n节（\n1-16\n周）、\n13-14\n节（\n1-16\n周）；三节连上可选择的上课时间：\n10-12\n节（\n1-11\n周）、\n13-15\n（\n1-11\n周）。注：第十节上课开始时间为\n16:25\n，第十三节上课开始时间为\n19:30\n。\n另外，任课教师在申请任务时所选上课时间及人数只作排课时参考，本科生院有权根据学校教室资源和排课的具体情况进行调整。\n5\n、学院（单位）工作安排：请各单位教务员于\n11\n月\n25\n日从新教务系统导出本单位公共选修课程及\nA\n系列课程教学任务汇总表（导出路径：通识课管理\n-\n通识选修课查询\n-\n通识选修课任务通知书下载），经任课教师检查无误并签字确认（如需修改，请在任务书上注明），加盖单位公章后于\n11\n月\n26\n日下午\n17:00\n前送本科生院教学运行科（行政楼\n306\n）\n。\n联系人：朱老师    联系电话：\n85286194\n附件：\n新教务系统（正方教务系统）教师申请公共选修课程、A系列课程及美育课程教学任务操作手册 .docx\n本科生院\n2025\n年\n11\n月\n20\n日","attachments":[{"name":"新教务系统（正方教务系统）教师申请公共选修课程、A系列课程及美育课程教学任务操作手册 .docx","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/11/68/42422c9843f0b8c01e1c97ea2810/76225c38-6ffb-4a91-a98e-ed49e33a13bc.docx"}],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:13:10+08:00"}